{"id":"a2fa942a71444f31","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-rosenberg.md","title":"One-step Rosenberg degree reduction","display":"thm-rosenberg — One-step Rosenberg degree reduction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-rosenberg","aliases":["27-thm-rosenberg"],"display":"thm-rosenberg — One-step Rosenberg degree reduction","depends_on":["[[27-df-pseudobool]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.6.1","source_statement":"Theorem 13.17","source_printed_pages":"594","source_pdf_pages":"618","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-rosenberg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-rosenberg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rosenberg — One-step Rosenberg degree reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.6.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"594"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"618"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{&gt;0}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k\\subseteq N\">\\(A_k\\subseteq N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_k\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(c_k\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[m]\">\\(k\\in[m]\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,\\ell\\in A_1\">\\(j,\\ell\\in A_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\ne\\ell\">\\(j\\ne\\ell\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(M\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M&gt;|c_1|\">\\(M&gt;|c_1|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>）满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^m c_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i)\">\\(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^m c_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B\\to\\mathbb B^{n+1}\">\\(\\iota:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B\\to\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(g:\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 由下式定义；空积为 1。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota(x,y)\\coloneqq x\\cup\\{(n+1,y)\\}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ y\\in\\mathbb B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota(x,y)\\coloneqq x\\cup\\{(n+1,y)\\}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ y\\in\\mathbb B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g(z)\\coloneqq c_1z_{n+1}\\prod_{i\\in A_1\\setminus\\{j,\\ell\\}}z_i+\\sum_{k=2}^m c_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}z_i-M(z_jz_\\ell-2z_jz_{n+1}-2z_\\ell z_{n+1}+3z_{n+1})\\quad(z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g(z)\\coloneqq c_1z_{n+1}\\prod_{i\\in A_1\\setminus\\{j,\\ell\\}}z_i+\\sum_{k=2}^m c_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}z_i-M(z_jz_\\ell-2z_jz_{n+1}-2z_\\ell z_{n+1}+3z_{n+1})\\quad(z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(g(\\iota(x,x_jx_\\ell))=f(x)\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B\\;(y\\ne x_jx_\\ell\\Rightarrow g(\\iota(x,y))&lt;f(x))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(g(\\iota(x,x_jx_\\ell))=f(x)\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B\\;(y\\ne x_jx_\\ell\\Rightarrow g(\\iota(x,y))&lt;f(x))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max_{z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}}g(z)=\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max_{z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}}g(z)=\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 13.17 陈述和证明已核对；将书中 “M sufficiently large” 明确取为其证明中的 M&gt;|c_1|，同时补明 j≠ℓ。惩罚 P=x_jx_ℓ−2x_jy−2x_ℓy+3y 在 y=x_jx_ℓ 时为 0，在其余四个输入为 1 或 3。替换第一单项式的值变化绝对值≤|c_1|，故错误 y 严格降低目标。重复作用于高次项可实现二次化；此原子仅断言单步等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（见 [[27-df-pseudobool]]）满足 $\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^m c_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i)$。$\\iota:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B\\to\\mathbb B^{n+1}$ 与 $g:\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb R$ 由下式定义；空积为 1。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A_k\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"c_k\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[m]","display":false},{"tex":"j,\\ell\\in A_1","display":false},{"tex":"j\\ne\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"M>|c_1|","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^m c_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B\\to\\mathbb B^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(x,y)\\coloneqq x\\cup\\{(n+1,y)\\}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ y\\in\\mathbb B).","display":true},{"tex":"g(z)\\coloneqq c_1z_{n+1}\\prod_{i\\in A_1\\setminus\\{j,\\ell\\}}z_i+\\sum_{k=2}^m c_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}z_i-M(z_jz_\\ell-2z_jz_{n+1}-2z_\\ell z_{n+1}+3z_{n+1})\\quad(z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(g(\\iota(x,x_jx_\\ell))=f(x)\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B\\;(y\\ne x_jx_\\ell\\Rightarrow g(\\iota(x,y))<f(x))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\max_{z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}}g(z)=\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(x).","display":true}],"bytes":2117,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-554","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-rosenberg|thm-rosenberg — One-step Rosenberg degree reduction]]"}],"outgoing":["04a7d534f0d6e0dd"]}